85
00:24:55.467 --> 00:25:09.267
The request is denied with module_requires_upgrade; no new job is created.

86
00:25:09.267 --> 00:25:16.267
Original Gold test: Training Echo is enabled and visible in the catalog.

87
00:25:16.267 --> 00:25:22.267
Enter the test text and select Run. The following submission is the original recorded action.

88
00:25:22.267 --> 00:25:49.267
The accepted job is queued and executed. Wait for its status to change.

89
00:25:49.267 --> 00:25:54.267
