100
00:29:00.067 --> 00:29:22.267
Training Echo and Coptis are both disabled and hidden.

101
00:29:22.267 --> 00:29:39.409
After closeout: this read-only tour shows where to find the catalog and retained results.

102
00:29:39.409 --> 00:29:53.451
Open Skill Catalog from the sidebar. Training Echo is hidden after the final disable.

103
00:29:53.451 --> 00:30:12.437
The catalog contains the currently available skills. Historical results remain in Runs.

104
00:30:12.437 --> 00:30:26.577
Click Runs. The successful training_echo entry from the Silver test is still retained.

105
00:30:26.577 --> 00:30:38.513
Open VISUALIZE on that run to inspect its saved output.

106
00:30:38.513 --> 00:30:53.510
Table shows the original test input and its character count: 36.

107
00:30:53.510 --> 00:31:08.482
Raw exposes the saved CSV. This is the original result, not a new module run.

108
00:31:08.482 --> 00:31:22.400
Close returns to Runs. Disabling a module hides it from the catalog without erasing this history.

109
00:31:22.400 --> 00:31:38.733
Recorded closeout: restore both test fixtures to their original Platinum subscriptions.

110
00:31:38.733 --> 00:31:55.067
Successful jobs and results remain available as release evidence.

111
00:31:55.067 --> 00:32:11.400
